  L5.u8_at RSEGS M (a + 4) b4 -> L5.u8_at RSEGS M (a + 5) b5 -> L5.u8_at RSEGS M (a + 6) b6 ->
  rdn RSEGS M (Z_to_bv 64 a) 7 = Some [Z_to_bv 8 b0; Z_to_bv 8 b1; Z_to_bv 8 b2; Z_to_bv 8 b3; Z_to_bv 8 b4; Z_to_bv 8 b5; Z_to_bv 8 b6].
